{"id":"vod_bf_28912","vodId":"28912","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"散华礼弥","name_cn":"散华礼弥","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/2297625b7048e8cdc7dca1ce33972e02.jpg"},"summary":"散华礼弥（内田真礼 配音）本该是一个快乐活泼的女孩，可是与亡母过分想象的外貌激发了父亲散华团一郎（石冢运升 配音）超限度的溺爱和束缚，这让礼弥感到痛苦万分，甚至因此而失足从悬崖上摔落而死。没想到，礼弥的死却促成了她和偶然间邂逅的少年降谷千紘（木村良平 配音）之间的一段缘分。为了使爱猫复活，对僵尸极其狂热的降谷研发了一种怪异的药剂，他将这种药剂用在了已死的礼弥身上，没想到，礼弥居然以僵尸的形式重生了。　　就这样，僵尸礼弥顺其自然的成为了降谷家的寄宿者，而为了使礼弥能够重新成为普通的女孩，降谷开始为了研究新的药剂而开始了奔波。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 06:15:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sanhualimi/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:00.713Z"}